  "notes": "コラボ is a shortened form of コラボレーション (collaboration). Very commonly used in entertainment, fashion, food, and marketing.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- AとBがコラボする: A and B collaborate\n- Aとのコラボ: collaboration with A\n- コラボ{商品|しょうひん}: collaboration product\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- コラボ{商品|しょうひん}: collaboration merchandise\n- コラボカフェ: collaboration café (themed café tied to an anime, game, etc.)\n- コラボイベント: collaboration event\n- {限定|げんてい}コラボ: limited-edition collaboration\n\nUSAGE:\nコラボ is extremely common in modern Japanese, especially in marketing and pop culture. Brands frequently release コラボ{商品|しょうひん} featuring characters from anime, games, and other media.",
